I pray you guys don't die inside this obstacle course.

1680
01:49:10,391 --> 01:49:11,891
恐竜たちよ。
Dinosaurs.

1681
01:49:12,191 --> 01:49:14,891
こんな感じにさっき。ね、ちょ、
