まばっちゃってすいません状態です。ちょっと。
Sorry, it's all scattered everywhere. Just a sec.

1684
01:49:24,391 --> 01:49:25,391
出発前。
Before departure.

1685
01:49:27,391 --> 01:49:28,891
あ、必ず拠点に置いて、
Ah, definitely leave it at base,

1686
01:49:29,391 --> 01:49:31,891
参加者景品あるんだって行きたいな。ねえ！
They say there are participant prizes, I wanna go. Right?!

1687
01:49:34,891 --> 01:49:37,891
てかもうこのへんなくなってもいいまである。これで。
At this point, I wouldn't even mind if this stuff disappeared. With this.

1688
01:49:38,891 --> 01:49:42,391
いや、なくなってもいいならもういいね。いっそね。いっそ、
Well, if it's fine if it's gone, then even better. Might as well, might as well,

1689
