The one that was weird before...

4153
04:24:35,012 --> 04:24:37,692
とんでけ大変なんだよ！
It's such a pain when they fly away!

4154
04:24:40,112 --> 04:24:41,352
おかしくなっちまうじゃねえか、バカたれ！
You're driving me crazy, you idiots!

4155
04:24:45,072 --> 04:24:46,092
入れるか？
Can I enter?

4156
04:24:46,292 --> 04:24:46,772
入れた。
Entered.

4157
04:24:47,252 --> 04:24:49,272
