Though, I might not have the leisure to watch unless someone else is playing.

4164
04:25:09,649 --> 04:25:10,479
まあ、そうだよね
Well, that's true,

4165
04:25:10,549 --> 04:25:12,419
私はそれで見てやってたけど。
though I watched and did it that way.

4166
04:25:12,929 --> 04:25:15,789
