いやだからここ来て
No, come over here!

4177
04:26:08,035 --> 04:26:10,045
いなテレポーターまで来れるかい?
Ina, can you make it to the teleporter?

4178
04:26:10,265 --> 04:26:11,935
あ、じゃあ戻り
Ah, then are you heading back—

4179
04:26:11,935 --> 04:26:12,495
ます?
are you heading back?

4180
04:26:12,495 --> 04:26:13,325
うん、戻ってきてほしい。
Yeah, I want you to come back.

