な、なんだって
Wh-What did you say?

4401
04:40:37,409 --> 04:40:41,109
う、う、う、そ、そんな、う、う、う
No, no way, u-u-u...

4402
04:40:45,077 --> 04:40:48,027
よ、ここで
Alright, right here.

4403
04:40:56,753 --> 04:40:58,543
ん？なんか、なんかずっと
Hm? Something, something kept...

4404
04:41:05,221 --> 04:41:07,901
ええと、こうやって繊維とって
Um, like this, gathering fiber...

4405
04:41:11,111 --> 04:41:15,111
あれ、寝袋、寝袋、寝袋、寝袋
Wait, sleeping bag, sleeping bag, sleeping bag...

4406
04:41:16,273 --> 04:41:18,883
え、なんか飛んでる、めっちゃ攻撃されてる
Eh, something's flying, I'm getting attacked like crazy.

4407
